{
  "roles": [
    {
      "id": "swiftwind",
      "name": "疾風",
      "params": {
        "hp": 20,
        "atk": 5,
        "def": 2,
        "spe": 13,
        "bra": 1
      },
      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "swiftwind_gain_spe_on_attack",
          "trigger": "afterRoleAttack",
          "actions": [
            {
              "addStatToken": {
                "stat": "spe",
                "value": 1
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "攻撃後 Speトークン+1"
        },
        {
          "id": "swiftwind_gain_bra_on_spe_threshold",
          "trigger": "onStatTotalChanged",
          "condition": {
            "stat": "spe",
            "threshold": {
              "from": 15,
              "step": 5
            },
            "direction": "up"
          },
          "actions": [
            {
              "addStatToken": {
                "stat": "bra",
                "value": 1
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "Spe合計が15以上で5刻みを跨ぐたびBraトークン+1"
        },
        {
          "id": "swiftwind_spend_spe_reduce_damage",
          "trigger": "beforeDamageTaken",
          "playerChoice": {
            "spendStatToken": {
              "stat": "spe",
              "min": 0,
              "max": "any"
            }
          },
          "actions": [
            {
              "reduceIncomingDamageBy": "spent"
            }
          ],
          "text": "被ダメージ時、追加Speトークンを自動で消費して同量だけ被ダメ軽減"
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "basic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "anger",
      "name": "憤怒",
      "params": {
        "hp": 20,
        "atk": 11,
        "def": 0,
        "spe": 5,
        "bra": 1
      },
      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "anger_gain_atk_on_damage",
          "trigger": "afterDamageTaken",
          "actions": [
            {
              "addStatToken": {
                "stat": "atk",
                "value": {
                  "ratioOf": "damageTaken",
                  "ratio": 0.5,
                  "round": "floor"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "HPが2減るごとにAtkトークン+1（受けたダメージ/2を切り捨て）"
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "basic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "monster",
      "name": "怪物",
      "params": {
        "hp": 10,
        "atk": 10,
        "def": 20,
        "spe": 10,
        "bra": 1
      },
      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "monster_final_duel_curse",
          "trigger": "onAlivePlayersChanged",
          "condition": {
            "alivePlayers": 2
          },
          "actions": [
            {
              "setMaxHp": 1
            },
            {
              "setHp": {
                "min": 1
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "残り2人になった瞬間、最大HP=1（現在HPは1に調整）"
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "basic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bomb",
      "name": "爆弾",
      "params": {
        "hp": 20,
        "atk": 8,
        "def": 3,
        "spe": 8,
        "bra": 1
      },
      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "bomb_self_blowback",
          "trigger": "afterDealingDamage",
          "condition": {
            "sources": [
              "role",
              "card"
            ]
          },
          "actions": [
            {
              "selfDamage": {
                "value": {
                  "ratioOf": "damageDealt",
                  "ratio": 0.25,
                  "round": "floor"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "与えたダメージの1/4を自傷（切り捨て）"
        },
        {
          "id": "bomb_thorns",
          "trigger": "afterDamageTaken",
          "source": "attacker",
          "condition": {
            "sources": [
              "role",
              "card"
            ]
          },
          "actions": [
            {
              "dealDamageToSource": {
                "value": {
                  "ratioOf": "damageTaken",
                  "ratio": 0.5,
                  "round": "floor"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "受けたダメージの1/2を相手に反射（切り捨て）"
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "basic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "murderer",
      "name": "殺人",
      "params": {
        "hp": 20,
        "atk": 6,
        "def": 2,
        "spe": 8,
        "bra": 2
      },
      "abilities": [
        {
          "id": "murderer_gain_on_kill",
          "trigger": "onKill",
          "actions": [
            {
              "addStatToken": {
                "stat": "atk",
                "value": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "addStatToken": {
                "stat": "spe",
                "value": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "addStatToken": {
                "stat": "bra",
                "value": 1
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "殺害するたびにAtk+1 / Spe+1 / Bra+1（トークン）"
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "basic",
        "synergy:bloodied_sword"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "discharge",
      "name": "放電",
      "params": {
        "hp": 20,
        "atk": 5,
        "def": 4,
        "spe": 5,
        "bra": 2
      },
      "text": "ターンの終わりに余ったBraを蓄電トークンとして蓄積する。自分のターン中に放電すると、(蓄電トークン^2)の感電トークンを自分以外の全員に付与する。感電トークン5つにつき、そのプレイヤーはそのターンBraを1使えない。使えなかったBra1につき、感電トークンを5つ捨てる。自分は感電トークンによるBra減衰が起こらない。",
      "tags": [
        "advanced"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "doctor",
      "name": "医師",
      "params": {
        "hp": 20,
        "atk": 4,
        "def": 3,
        "spe": 5,
        "bra": 2
      },
      "text": "Braを1消費して治療/麻酔/手術/整形のいずれかを実行できる支援ロール。",
      "tags": [
        "advanced",
        "support"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "flame",
      "name": "火炎",
      "params": {
        "hp": 20,
        "atk": 3,
        "def": 5,
        "spe": 7,
        "bra": 2
      },
      "text": "Braを消費して炎上を付与。炎上はターン終了時に炎上値だけダメージを与え、減少。火炎自身は炎上ダメージの代わりに回復する。",
      "tags": [
        "advanced"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "resonate",
      "name": "反響",
      "params": {
        "hp": 20,
        "atk": 6,
        "def": 3,
        "spe": 6,
        "bra": 1
      },
      "text": "すべての攻撃が連続攻撃になる。最初のダメージは通常のロール攻撃ダメージ（Atk-Def、最小1）で、その後は与えるダメージが1未満になるまで『与えるダメージを2/3にし、ダメージを与える』を繰り返す。誰かにダメージを与えるたび、自分は固定1ダメージを受ける。",
      "tags": [
        "advanced"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "efficiency",
      "name": "効率",
      "params": {
        "hp": 12,
        "atk": 2,
        "def": 1,
        "spe": 3,
        "bra": 2
      },
      "text": "全てのアイテム効果が2倍になる。",
      "tags": [
        "advanced"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "greed",
      "name": "貪欲",
      "params": {
        "hp": 20,
        "atk": 5,
        "def": 5,
        "spe": 5,
        "bra": 2
      },
      "text": "追加トークンを獲得した時、代わりに獲得するはずだったトークン数だけHPを回復する。",
      "tags": [
        "advanced"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "postpone",
      "name": "延期",
      "params": {
        "hp": 20,
        "atk": 4,
        "def": 3,
        "spe": 10,
        "bra": 2
      },
      "text": "最初の行動後、残りのBraで全員の行動後に行動ができる。",
      "tags": [
        "advanced"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "jester",
